stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Received
  Received --> Duplicate: inbox key exists
  Duplicate --> Acknowledged
  Received --> Processing: first delivery
  Processing --> Acknowledged: success (inbox + effect committed)
  Processing --> Retry1m: transient error
  Retry1m --> Processing: after 1 min + jitter
  Retry1m --> Retry10m: fails again
  Retry10m --> Processing: after 10 min
  Retry10m --> Retry1h: fails again
  Retry1h --> Processing: after 1 h
  Retry1h --> DeadLettered: retries exhausted
  Processing --> DeadLettered: permanent error
  DeadLettered --> Replayed: operator fix and re-publish
  Replayed --> Received
  Acknowledged --> [*]
